 terms:['Prompt injection','Prompt leaking','Bias','Counterfactual augmentation'],diagram:['Untrusted source','Data boundary','Minimum tool permissions','Policy validation','Bias + adversarial evaluation'],source:'Slide 69–70: injection/leaking, system prompt example, TIED/TAB, diversity dan counterfactual augmentation. Batas perlindungan dan backend controls adalah penjelasan tambahan.'
